[
  {
    "content_id": "10064001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我這作長老的寫信給親愛的該猶，你是我本著真理所愛的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄，我願你凡事順利，身體像靈魂一樣健康。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;一些弟兄來為你作見證，說你忠心地遵行真理，這使我非常歡喜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;沒有比聽見自己的孩子遵行真理更使我歡喜了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄，你常常忠心地照顧素不相識的弟兄，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他們把你的愛心告訴了教會。願你照著上帝喜悅的方式繼續幫助他們出行，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因為他們為了主的名四處傳道，不接受非信徒的任何幫助。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我們理當接待這樣的人，好成為他們傳揚真理的同工。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我曾寫信給你那裡的教會，但愛當頭領的丟特腓不接待我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因此，我若去你們那裡，必揭露他的所作所為，他怎樣惡言中傷我們。不僅如此，他還拒絕接待弟兄，並且禁止別人接待，甚至將接待的人趕出教會。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄，不要效法罪惡，要效法美善。行善的人屬於上帝，行惡的人不認識上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;低米丟得到了眾人的好評，真理也為他作見證，我們也為他作見證。你知道我們的見證是真實的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我還有許多事要告訴你，但不想藉助筆墨，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;只希望很快見到你，跟你當面暢談。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;願你平安！這裡的朋友們都問候你，請代我一一問候你那邊的朋友。</p>"
  }
]